\f1 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Because instance methods defined in the root class can be sent to class objects, when the receiver is a class object, this method returns YES if \i aClass\i0  is NSObject, NO otherwise.\
